Description: Wild OS Archive
 Archive opens ZIP, 7z, RAR and TAR archives and GZ, XZ, BZ2 and ZST
 files, on libarchive. Browse an archive's folders with picture
 thumbnails, extract all of it or just what you pick, check that every
 file in it is intact, and make new ZIP or 7z archives. Archives are read
 only: adding files makes a new archive and leaves the original as it
 was. Extracting never writes outside the folder you chose. Nothing is
 sent anywhere.
